1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 21=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:49,128 --> 00:01:50,710
Take a look at these vegetables.

7
00:01:50,719 --> 00:01:51,479
Freshly picked.

8
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:52,839
One coin a bunch.

9
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:54,839
And look at this big pumpkin.

10
00:01:56,780 --> 00:01:59,300
(Sweet Taro Soup)

11
00:02:02,959 --> 00:02:03,958
(North Market Street)

12
00:02:03,959 --> 00:02:05,240
Tofu!

13
00:02:05,560 --> 00:02:06,839
Tofu!

14
00:02:08,039 --> 00:02:09,999
Chrysanthemum greens! Cherries!

15
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,519
(Han Ju, Han Liang's Older Sister)

16
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:13,639
The vegetables here are the freshest.

17
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:15,199
Tofu!

18
00:02:17,639 --> 00:02:19,239
Let's have a look over there.

19
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:21,479
Freshly picked this morning.

20
00:02:24,319 --> 00:02:26,199
Chrysanthemum greens! Cherries!

21
00:02:26,639 --> 00:02:28,359
Chrysanthemum greens! Cherries!

22
00:02:29,319 --> 00:02:31,759
Chrysanthemum greens! Cherries!

23
00:02:35,080 --> 00:02:37,120
Chrysanthemum greens! Cherries!

24
00:02:37,880 --> 00:02:39,370
How much are the chrysanthemum greens?

25
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:41,039
One coin for two bunches.

26
00:02:49,599 --> 00:02:50,638
You've got a large basket

27
00:02:50,639 --> 00:02:51,959
and another basket,

28
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:53,519
and a child with you.

29
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:55,440
Can you manage all that by yourself?

30
00:02:55,719 --> 00:02:57,478
My husband brought me here.

31
00:02:57,480 --> 00:02:58,920
He's gone to sell the game he caught.

32
00:02:59,400 --> 00:03:01,600
Now we have another mouth to feed,

33
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:03,478
so we need to earn more.

34
00:03:03,479 --> 00:03:04,720
All right.

35
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:06,320
I'm trying to sell things.

36
00:03:06,888 --> 00:03:08,150
I'll take these two bunches,

37
00:03:08,159 --> 00:03:09,759
and one coin's worth of cherries.

38
00:03:11,039 --> 00:03:12,199
Certainly.

39
00:03:24,952 --> 00:03:26,230
Come again if you like them.

40
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:27,079
All right.

41
00:03:30,719 --> 00:03:32,679
Chrysanthemum greens! Cherries!

42
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:33,959
Fresh chives.

43
00:03:35,039 --> 00:03:36,199
Two coins a bunch.

44
00:03:37,496 --> 00:03:39,070
Could you make them a little cheaper?

45
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:40,758
Lady Han,

46
00:03:40,759 --> 00:03:42,359
you're Scholar Han's sister.

47
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:44,759
Why haggle over a few coins
for two bunches of vegetables?

48
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:56,799
A few coins are still money.

49
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:57,799
What family

50
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:59,438
doesn't count every coin they spend?

51
00:03:59,439 --> 00:04:00,718
Scholar Han's money

52
00:04:00,719 --> 00:04:02,079
doesn't just fall from the sky.

53
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:03,639
Why shouldn't I haggle?

54
00:04:09,879 --> 00:04:11,720
Your chives are really fresh.

55
00:04:11,740 --> 00:04:12,679
I'll take two bunches.

56
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:14,079
Give us a better price.

57
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:15,799
They're already very cheap.

58
00:04:16,072 --> 00:04:18,270
The sooner you sell out,
the sooner you can pack up.

59
00:04:18,270 --> 00:04:20,568
If you stay out here too long,
you'll wear yourself out,

60
00:04:20,616 --> 00:04:22,390
and look,
the vegetables will start to wilt.

61
00:04:22,399 --> 00:04:24,800
Then you won't be able
to get a good price for them.

62
00:04:25,879 --> 00:04:26,638
All right.

63
00:04:26,639 --> 00:04:28,079
Three coins for two bunches.

64
00:04:30,519 --> 00:04:32,159
We'll buy from you again.

65
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:33,000
Certainly.

66
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:36,440
Here you go.

67
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:46,024
No wonder my brother told me
to spend more time with you.

68
00:04:46,759 --> 00:04:49,480
I may not have
learned a scholar's skills,

69
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:52,240
but I certainly picked up
a scholar's concern for appearances.

70
00:04:53,592 --> 00:04:55,032
I used to be just like you.

71
00:04:55,144 --> 00:04:57,030
Whenever I saw
my mother arguing with someone

72
00:04:57,040 --> 00:04:58,198
over a single coin,

73
00:04:58,199 --> 00:04:59,679
I'd feel embarrassed.

74
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:00,959
You'll get used to it.

75
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:02,470
When you're running a household,

76
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:03,919
every coin you save

77
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:05,120
adds up.

78
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:07,719
I've learned my lesson.

79
00:05:07,879 --> 00:05:10,000
Kind words cost nothing,
so say as many as you like.

80
00:05:10,072 --> 00:05:11,150
But when it comes to money,

81
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:12,719
not a single coin more.

82
00:05:27,464 --> 00:05:28,560
What are you looking at?

83
00:05:28,584 --> 00:05:29,288
That's the house.

84
00:05:29,310 --> 00:05:30,159
Knock on the door.

85
00:05:30,160 --> 00:05:31,000
All right.

86
00:05:31,079 --> 00:05:31,599
Go!

87
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:34,239
- Open up!
- Open up!

88
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:35,318
Come out!

89
00:05:35,319 --> 00:05:36,958
Han is our thirteenth brother's wife.

90
00:05:36,959 --> 00:05:38,438
She must remain a widow for him.

91
00:05:38,440 --> 00:05:39,490
- That's right!
- Exactly!

92
00:05:39,500 --> 00:05:41,318
Her husband is dead.
She must remain a widow!

93
00:05:41,319 --> 00:05:42,440
- Exactly!
- Exactly!

94
00:05:42,639 --> 00:05:43,479
Open up!

95
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:45,159
She must remain a widow! Open up!

96
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:47,958
Open up!

97
00:05:47,959 --> 00:05:49,159
- Open up!
- Open the door!

98
00:05:49,160 --> 00:05:49,799
Open up!

99
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:50,838
Hand her over!

100
00:05:50,839 --> 00:05:51,559
Open up!

101
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:52,039
Open up!

102
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:53,039
(Clan Leader Zhang)
Hand her over! Come out!

103
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:53,799
Come out!

104
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:55,078
Open up!

105
00:05:55,079 --> 00:05:55,758
Come out!

106
00:05:55,759 --> 00:05:56,359
Open up!

107
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:57,399
Open up!

108
00:06:08,079 --> 00:06:09,480
You've all come a long way.

109
00:06:09,920 --> 00:06:10,880
I apologize

110
00:06:11,959 --> 00:06:13,279
for not being here to welcome you.

111
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:18,320
Scholar Han,

112
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:20,239
you brought your sister home

113
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:22,278
without our Zhang family's consent,

114
00:06:22,279 --> 00:06:24,519
and you still haven't sent
her back after all this time.

115
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:26,800
Just what are you trying to do?

116
00:06:26,872 --> 00:06:28,360
After the way you treated my daughter,

117
00:06:28,370 --> 00:06:31,120
(Feng Lin, Han Liang's Mother)
you have the nerve to demand her back?

118
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:37,599
Sir,

119
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:39,680
my brother-in-law was an only son.

120
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:41,839
His parents passed away long ago.

121
00:06:42,056 --> 00:06:42,968
Now my sister

122
00:06:42,980 --> 00:06:45,150
has no parents-in-law above her
and no children below,

123
00:06:45,160 --> 00:06:47,096
nor any of her husband's
brothers or their wives.

124
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:48,959
What is wrong

125
00:06:49,279 --> 00:06:50,800
with bringing her back home?

126
00:06:51,240 --> 00:06:53,112
The late Emperor made it clear long ago

127
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:55,470
that a woman should remain
faithful to one husband for life

128
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:57,000
and never remarry.

129
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:59,720
Your sister is already
a wife of the Zhang family.

130
00:06:59,816 --> 00:07:01,870
Then she should remain
a widow for her late husband.

131
00:07:01,879 --> 00:07:02,518
- Yes.
- Yes.

132
00:07:02,519 --> 00:07:03,920
The late Emperor also said

133
00:07:04,136 --> 00:07:06,710
that remaining a widow must be voluntary
and cannot be forced.

134
00:07:06,720 --> 00:07:08,120
Under the laws of our dynasty,

135
00:07:08,168 --> 00:07:09,430
when a woman's husband dies

136
00:07:09,439 --> 00:07:11,040
and she has no surviving parents-in-law,

137
00:07:11,079 --> 00:07:13,040
her own parents may decide for her.

138
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:16,759
I will not allow
my daughter to remain a widow.

139
00:07:17,199 --> 00:07:18,078
Your son

140
00:07:18,079 --> 00:07:20,159
is going to become an official someday.

141
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:21,976
His reputation matters above all.

142
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:25,000
Having a sister known for her
unwavering fidelity to her late husband

143
00:07:25,279 --> 00:07:28,639
would also benefit him.

144
00:07:28,759 --> 00:07:30,360
That's right.

145
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:36,480
I had no choice.

146
00:07:40,319 --> 00:07:42,000
Sister!

147
00:07:48,720 --> 00:07:49,839
Sir,

148
00:07:50,879 --> 00:07:52,279
I beg to differ.

149
00:07:53,759 --> 00:07:54,719
Becoming an official

150
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:57,519
depends on genuine
ability and hard work.

151
00:07:58,472 --> 00:08:00,390
If, for the sake
of becoming an official,

152
00:08:00,959 --> 00:08:02,839
a man would
sacrifice his own sister's life,

153
00:08:03,560 --> 00:08:04,599
then such a man

154
00:08:05,439 --> 00:08:06,800
is lower than an animal.

155
00:08:07,959 --> 00:08:09,680
He isn't even worthy
of being called a man,

156
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:14,599
let alone an official.

157
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:15,440
You...

158
00:08:15,519 --> 00:08:17,199
Well said!

159
00:08:17,959 --> 00:08:20,599
That deserves a hearty toast.

160
00:08:21,399 --> 00:08:22,559
Who is this man?

161
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:24,000
This is none of his business.

162
00:08:29,079 --> 00:08:30,159
Your sister

163
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:31,958
was formally married
into our Zhang family

164
00:08:31,959 --> 00:08:33,520
with all the proper rites.

165
00:08:34,120 --> 00:08:35,870
In life, she belongs
to the Zhang family.

166
00:08:35,879 --> 00:08:37,678
In death, she belongs
to the Zhang family.

167
00:08:37,679 --> 00:08:38,839
She must remain a widow.

168
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:39,479
Hand her over!

169
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:39,839
Yes!

170
00:08:39,840 --> 00:08:41,040
She must remain a widow!

171
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:42,119
Hand her over!

172
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:44,959
- Hand her over!
- Hand her over!

173
00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:46,239
Hand her over!

174
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:47,439
Don't resort to violence!

175
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:49,199
We can talk this through.
Don't hit people!

176
00:08:49,200 --> 00:08:50,319
Hand her over!

177
00:08:50,320 --> 00:08:51,079
Hand her over!

178
00:08:51,080 --> 00:08:52,079
- Hand her over!
- Right!

179
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:53,319
Even if I die,

180
00:08:53,320 --> 00:08:55,398
I won't hand over my daughter.

181
00:08:55,400 --> 00:08:57,960
If you want to take my daughter today,

182
00:08:58,008 --> 00:08:59,990
you'll have to step over
my dead body first.

183
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:00,719
Hand her over!

184
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:01,680
Mother!

185
00:09:01,799 --> 00:09:02,879
Mother!

186
00:09:03,759 --> 00:09:05,119
Don't hit anyone!

187
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:08,079
Sister!

188
00:09:08,080 --> 00:09:08,918
Don't go out there.

189
00:09:08,920 --> 00:09:10,920
If you go out now,
you'll only make things worse.

190
00:09:10,984 --> 00:09:12,280
Someone could even end up dead.

191
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:17,719
Grandpa Tu,

192
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:18,798
keep an eye on her.

193
00:09:18,799 --> 00:09:19,500
All right.

194
00:09:21,279 --> 00:09:22,440
My tung oil!

195
00:09:23,879 --> 00:09:24,959
Move aside!

196
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:26,038
Hand her over!

197
00:09:26,039 --> 00:09:27,719
- Hand her over!
- Hand her over!

198
00:09:27,720 --> 00:09:29,239
Hand her over!

199
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:32,079
Hand her over!

200
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:34,920
Hand her over!

201
00:09:57,559 --> 00:09:58,839
Who did this?

202
00:10:01,519 --> 00:10:02,440
The tung oil!

203
00:10:02,519 --> 00:10:03,599
Tung oil?

204
00:10:05,039 --> 00:10:06,239
Who did this?

205
00:10:06,240 --> 00:10:07,359
Who did it?

206
00:10:09,600 --> 00:10:10,999
Help me up.

207
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:17,280
Who spilled the tung oil?

208
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:19,560
Who did it?

209
00:10:19,570 --> 00:10:20,792
Under the laws of our dynasty,

210
00:10:20,800 --> 00:10:22,750
forcing one's way
into a home to seize someone

211
00:10:22,759 --> 00:10:25,680
is punishable by one year
in prison and eighty strokes.

212
00:10:27,120 --> 00:10:28,479
Eighty strokes, huh?

213
00:10:33,272 --> 00:10:35,280
Striking someone
with one's hands or feet

214
00:10:35,304 --> 00:10:37,496
without causing injury
is punishable by twenty strokes.

215
00:10:37,500 --> 00:10:39,660
If injury is caused,
the punishment is thirty strokes.

216
00:10:39,759 --> 00:10:41,400
Bruising or swelling
counts as an injury.

217
00:10:42,559 --> 00:10:44,040
Striking someone with an object

218
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:46,290
without causing injury
is punishable by thirty strokes.

219
00:10:46,300 --> 00:10:48,408
If injury is caused,
the punishment is forty strokes.

220
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:51,278
I'm reporting this to the authorities!

221
00:10:51,279 --> 00:10:52,798
I'll tell them someone

222
00:10:52,799 --> 00:10:55,079
gathered a mob to assault Scholar Han.

223
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:56,520
Just you wait.

224
00:10:58,480 --> 00:11:00,760
Children, come with me
to report them. Let's go!

225
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:02,959
Insulting and assaulting
an imperial student

226
00:11:03,519 --> 00:11:04,920
carries an even heavier penalty.

227
00:11:12,879 --> 00:11:14,760
Are you demanding
that my sister remain a widow

228
00:11:15,159 --> 00:11:17,440
out of respect
for propriety and righteousness,

229
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:20,079
or so that your Zhang clan

230
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:22,680
can pay less grain tax
and be exempt from compulsory labor?

231
00:11:24,960 --> 00:11:26,119
My sister

232
00:11:26,879 --> 00:11:28,280
respects propriety and righteousness

233
00:11:28,728 --> 00:11:30,870
and is willing to remain
a widow for her late husband.

234
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:33,239
But even
the lowliest creatures cling to life.

235
00:11:34,559 --> 00:11:35,680
Besides,

236
00:11:37,752 --> 00:11:40,560
my sister still has an aging mother
and a younger brother to care for.

237
00:11:40,648 --> 00:11:43,470
If she ignored the love that raised her
and the bond between siblings

238
00:11:43,480 --> 00:11:44,999
and simply ended her life,

239
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:47,040
wouldn't that
be both unfilial and unjust?

240
00:11:48,360 --> 00:11:50,079
For the sake
of a chastity memorial arch,

241
00:11:50,080 --> 00:11:52,072
you locked my sister in a small room,

242
00:11:52,296 --> 00:11:53,550
subjected her to cruel remarks,

243
00:11:53,550 --> 00:11:56,344
deprived her of food and clothing,
and drove her to take her own life.

244
00:11:57,879 --> 00:11:59,800
If I hadn't gone to see my sister,

245
00:12:00,808 --> 00:12:02,950
I'm afraid you would
have gotten your wish long ago,

246
00:12:02,960 --> 00:12:04,984
and she would have died
to preserve her chastity!

247
00:12:09,759 --> 00:12:10,959
Mister Lu,

248
00:12:10,960 --> 00:12:12,239
you were a Third Place Scholar

249
00:12:12,240 --> 00:12:14,380
and know better than anyone
how the authorities work.

250
00:12:14,392 --> 00:12:16,310
Tell me, if a widow
is driven to her death

251
00:12:16,320 --> 00:12:18,040
just to obtain a chastity memorial arch,

252
00:12:18,320 --> 00:12:20,758
will the authorities exempt
the clan from compulsory labor

253
00:12:20,759 --> 00:12:22,400
and reduce its grain tax?

254
00:12:23,879 --> 00:12:25,079
No.

255
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:30,119
When it comes to such greed,

256
00:12:30,120 --> 00:12:32,800
and such disregard
for basic human decency,

257
00:12:33,440 --> 00:12:35,239
once the authorities find out,

258
00:12:35,240 --> 00:12:38,160
they will not only revoke
the chastity memorial arch,

259
00:12:38,879 --> 00:12:42,239
but also severely
punish the clan leader,

260
00:12:42,639 --> 00:12:46,359
and may even implicate the entire clan.

261
00:12:46,480 --> 00:12:47,479
This...

262
00:12:47,480 --> 00:12:48,440
Clan Leader!

263
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:52,792
The Central City Patrol Office is here!

264
00:12:52,856 --> 00:12:53,790
The City Patrol Office?

265
00:12:53,799 --> 00:12:54,599
Go! Run!

266
00:12:54,600 --> 00:12:55,440
Run!

267
00:13:00,080 --> 00:13:02,800
The Central City Patrol Office is here!

268
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:08,959
Mother!

269
00:13:10,480 --> 00:13:11,479
My daughter!

270
00:13:11,799 --> 00:13:12,920
My daughter!

271
00:13:14,240 --> 00:13:15,079
Don't be afraid.

272
00:13:15,080 --> 00:13:16,119
My daughter,

273
00:13:16,720 --> 00:13:18,520
the Zhang family is gone.

274
00:13:19,080 --> 00:13:20,439
I'm here.

275
00:13:20,440 --> 00:13:21,440
Don't be afraid.

276
00:13:24,240 --> 00:13:25,839
The Zhang family is gone.

277
00:13:25,840 --> 00:13:27,359
Don't be afraid.

278
00:13:27,799 --> 00:13:29,239
I'm here.

279
00:13:40,320 --> 00:13:42,319
Your tung oil saved the day.

280
00:13:42,320 --> 00:13:44,296
We'll have something
extra for dinner tonight.

281
00:13:46,240 --> 00:13:47,239
Grandpa Tu,

282
00:13:47,240 --> 00:13:48,878
I'll buy another jar of tung oil later

283
00:13:48,879 --> 00:13:49,959
to replace yours.

284
00:13:50,039 --> 00:13:51,199
I still have more.

285
00:13:51,519 --> 00:13:53,320
I should pay for it.

286
00:13:55,399 --> 00:13:57,040
I'll buy you some small fish, too.

287
00:13:57,360 --> 00:13:58,638
We'll fry them for dinner.

288
00:13:58,639 --> 00:14:01,040
- Thank you, Scholar Han.
- Thank you, Scholar Han.

289
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:02,199
All right.

290
00:14:02,200 --> 00:14:03,359
It's all right now.

291
00:14:03,360 --> 00:14:04,319
- Let's clear out.
- Let's clear out.

292
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:06,640
Everyone, you can go home now.
- Let's go.

293
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:14,160
We couldn't have gotten
through today without you.

294
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:16,359
If Lanxiang hadn't been so quick-witted,

295
00:14:16,360 --> 00:14:19,119
the two of us
would have been outnumbered,

296
00:14:19,120 --> 00:14:21,719
and I'm afraid we couldn't
have protected my daughter.

297
00:14:21,720 --> 00:14:22,678
It's all right.

298
00:14:22,679 --> 00:14:24,160
Thank you.

299
00:14:24,240 --> 00:14:25,368
Auntie, don't you always say

300
00:14:25,370 --> 00:14:27,430
a close neighbor
is better than a distant relative?

301
00:14:27,440 --> 00:14:29,239
When our family first moved here,

302
00:14:29,240 --> 00:14:31,520
you and Scholar Han
helped us a great deal.

303
00:14:31,799 --> 00:14:34,119
Besides, I didn't
really do much just now.

304
00:14:34,320 --> 00:14:36,558
I only backed Scholar Han up

305
00:14:36,559 --> 00:14:38,040
and helped scare them off.

306
00:14:39,480 --> 00:14:41,999
It's all thanks to Lanxiang's
thorough knowledge of the law.

307
00:14:42,279 --> 00:14:43,760
Without lifting a finger,

308
00:14:44,120 --> 00:14:47,239
you saved
our family from a terrible ordeal.

309
00:14:48,919 --> 00:14:50,520
You're too kind, Scholar Han.

310
00:14:50,559 --> 00:14:53,719
I was merely showing off
what little I know before an expert.

311
00:14:53,720 --> 00:14:55,096
I hope I didn't embarrass myself.

312
00:14:57,940 --> 00:15:00,139
♪I can't forget♪

313
00:15:00,140 --> 00:15:01,859
♪My longing fills my eyes♪

314
00:15:01,860 --> 00:15:05,099
♪My longing lingers
like the fragrance of orchids♪

315
00:15:05,100 --> 00:15:09,100
♪I've walked through
frost-covered streets far and wide♪

316
00:15:09,820 --> 00:15:13,100
♪I'm blessed to have you
understand my tender heart♪

317
00:15:18,159 --> 00:15:20,879
What do you think of
Scholar Han next door?

318
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:25,959
Lanxiang only
taught me a few characters.

319
00:15:25,960 --> 00:15:28,160
How would I know what he's like?

320
00:15:29,200 --> 00:15:33,839
But Mister Lu thinks highly of him,

321
00:15:34,080 --> 00:15:37,160
so I imagine he's quite learned.

322
00:15:37,200 --> 00:15:40,239
Who said anything about his learning?

323
00:15:42,080 --> 00:15:43,160
His looks?

324
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:44,760
He's quite good-looking.

325
00:15:44,879 --> 00:15:47,199
More handsome than I was at his age.

326
00:15:47,879 --> 00:15:49,239
You don't give our daughter's

327
00:15:49,240 --> 00:15:51,520
future any thought at all, do you?

328
00:15:56,279 --> 00:15:57,640
You mean

329
00:15:59,519 --> 00:16:00,839
Lanxiang

330
00:16:01,399 --> 00:16:02,999
and Scholar Han?

331
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:08,199
I've been thinking

332
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:10,320
Lanxiang isn't getting any younger.

333
00:16:10,559 --> 00:16:12,599
If we keep putting this off,

334
00:16:12,639 --> 00:16:14,719
she may end up never marrying.

335
00:16:16,960 --> 00:16:18,839
We know

336
00:16:18,840 --> 00:16:20,999
how wonderful she is,

337
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:22,760
but when it comes
to finding her a match,

338
00:16:23,120 --> 00:16:25,079
the two families
still need to be well matched.

339
00:16:26,159 --> 00:16:27,959
Our humble backgrounds

340
00:16:29,559 --> 00:16:31,040
have put her at a disadvantage.

341
00:16:31,320 --> 00:16:34,520
Fortunately, there's
a family like Scholar Han's.

342
00:16:37,120 --> 00:16:39,839
I've always thought highly of him.

343
00:16:40,440 --> 00:16:42,359
And after what happened today,

344
00:16:42,440 --> 00:16:44,839
he'd rather sacrifice his own reputation

345
00:16:44,960 --> 00:16:46,999
than fail to protect his sister.

346
00:16:47,480 --> 00:16:50,959
Madam Han is also kind and honorable.

347
00:16:51,016 --> 00:16:52,550
If she became Lanxiang's mother-in-law,

348
00:16:52,559 --> 00:16:55,959
I'm sure she'd treat
her daughter-in-law well.

349
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:02,920
There's no use getting
so excited about it ourselves.

350
00:17:03,279 --> 00:17:05,320
We don't know
what the Han family thinks.

351
00:17:06,920 --> 00:17:08,359
I think Madam Han

352
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:10,439
feels the same way I do.

353
00:17:10,440 --> 00:17:11,599
Really?

354
00:17:11,759 --> 00:17:15,399
I don't think Madam Han
is the only one fond of Lanxiang.

355
00:17:15,599 --> 00:17:17,079
I'm afraid Scholar Han

356
00:17:17,240 --> 00:17:18,280
has long...

357
00:17:19,440 --> 00:17:21,439
That young man...

358
00:17:21,960 --> 00:17:24,200
No wonder he's been so attentive.

359
00:17:24,279 --> 00:17:26,679
So he had an ulterior motive all along.

360
00:17:26,680 --> 00:17:27,760
He didn't...

361
00:17:28,839 --> 00:17:29,919
Who knows? Someday

362
00:17:29,920 --> 00:17:32,079
he may really become our son-in-law.

363
00:17:32,319 --> 00:17:33,720
Nonsense.

364
00:17:36,720 --> 00:17:40,079
Lanxiang and Scholar Han

365
00:17:40,400 --> 00:17:41,520
would make a good match.

366
00:17:52,640 --> 00:17:53,800
They're here!

367
00:17:54,180 --> 00:17:59,099
(A Joyous Betrothal
Between the Yuan and Lin Families)

368
00:17:59,100 --> 00:18:03,900
(Glorify the Family Name)

369
00:18:17,976 --> 00:18:19,960
It's only the presentation
of betrothal gifts.

370
00:18:20,072 --> 00:18:22,150
Did they have to make
such a grand affair of it?

371
00:18:22,200 --> 00:18:24,730
Anyone who didn't know better
would think the wedding was today.

372
00:18:30,799 --> 00:18:32,200
That Xiuru is getting carried

373
00:18:32,280 --> 00:18:34,560
(Lin Residence, Huaqiong Courtyard)
away with herself.

374
00:18:34,880 --> 00:18:36,960
She's become unbearably conceited.

375
00:18:58,460 --> 00:19:03,740
(Miscellaneous Records of Yuefu
The Romance of Poetry)

376
00:19:03,759 --> 00:19:05,999
My son has followed the ancient rites

377
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:07,558
and bestowed generous gifts upon us.

378
00:19:07,559 --> 00:19:09,278
I dare not decline them.

379
00:19:09,279 --> 00:19:11,280
I gladly accept.

380
00:19:16,740 --> 00:19:20,140
(By request of Shide)

381
00:19:20,300 --> 00:19:23,620
(Lin Residence, Yujiao Garden)

382
00:19:26,079 --> 00:19:27,879
- Congratulations!
- Congratulations!

383
00:19:27,920 --> 00:19:28,970
The Yuan and Lin families

384
00:19:28,980 --> 00:19:30,118
are truly well matched.

385
00:19:30,119 --> 00:19:31,479
Congratulations, Xiuru.

386
00:19:31,480 --> 00:19:32,479
The Yuan and Lin families

387
00:19:32,480 --> 00:19:34,079
have completed the betrothal ceremony.

388
00:19:35,400 --> 00:19:37,078
They truly are a perfect match.

389
00:19:37,080 --> 00:19:38,392
What a wonderful marriage.

390
00:19:38,400 --> 00:19:40,392
The Yuan family
made even the betrothal ceremony

391
00:19:40,408 --> 00:19:41,760
such a grand occasion.

392
00:19:41,799 --> 00:19:44,240
The wedding will surely be even grander.

393
00:19:46,759 --> 00:19:49,078
Xiuru now has

394
00:19:49,079 --> 00:19:50,839
the best match among us.

395
00:20:12,960 --> 00:20:14,040
Xiuwan,

396
00:20:17,480 --> 00:20:19,399
if you're upset,

397
00:20:19,640 --> 00:20:21,679
talk to me about it.

398
00:20:23,440 --> 00:20:25,119
You're worrying too much, Mother.

399
00:20:25,759 --> 00:20:28,798
Grandfather said Xiuru's good marriage

400
00:20:28,799 --> 00:20:30,839
will benefit the entire Lin family.

401
00:20:31,720 --> 00:20:33,439
As a member of the Lin family,

402
00:20:34,079 --> 00:20:35,560
I'll naturally benefit as well.

403
00:20:41,519 --> 00:20:43,879
My poor child.

404
00:20:54,559 --> 00:20:57,000
I know how much you're hurting inside.

405
00:21:00,400 --> 00:21:02,119
Just look at Xiuru.

406
00:21:03,279 --> 00:21:05,839
In both background and looks,

407
00:21:05,880 --> 00:21:08,359
she falls short of you in every way.

408
00:21:08,599 --> 00:21:10,320
But look at her now.

409
00:21:11,680 --> 00:21:12,599
She...

410
00:21:14,160 --> 00:21:15,560
Mother.

411
00:21:17,759 --> 00:21:19,240
Everything in this world

412
00:21:19,480 --> 00:21:21,760
has its cause and its consequence.

413
00:21:22,799 --> 00:21:24,919
The consequences I face today

414
00:21:25,200 --> 00:21:27,599
were brought about
by my own past actions.

415
00:21:28,559 --> 00:21:30,240
Xiuru had nothing to do with it.

416
00:21:37,640 --> 00:21:39,359
It's all Du Cuique's fault,

417
00:21:39,960 --> 00:21:41,760
and Du Zheng's, too.

418
00:21:42,119 --> 00:21:45,000
Those two are utterly heartless.

419
00:21:51,000 --> 00:21:52,399
Xiuwan,

420
00:21:52,759 --> 00:21:54,639
I shouldn't have said that.

421
00:21:54,839 --> 00:21:56,758
I shouldn't have said that.

422
00:21:56,759 --> 00:21:58,358
I won't mention it again.

423
00:21:58,359 --> 00:21:59,919
Never again.

424
00:22:03,400 --> 00:22:05,359
After Grandfather
confined me to the house,

425
00:22:06,039 --> 00:22:08,280
Jinqi sent me many books

426
00:22:08,680 --> 00:22:10,399
and told me to read more,

427
00:22:10,599 --> 00:22:13,439
to look higher and farther,

428
00:22:13,440 --> 00:22:15,359
and see the world beyond this courtyard.

429
00:22:18,279 --> 00:22:19,800
Jinqi said

430
00:22:20,759 --> 00:22:23,119
there's no turning back in life.

431
00:22:24,200 --> 00:22:26,359
Since I made a terrible mistake,

432
00:22:27,240 --> 00:22:28,399
for the rest of my life,

433
00:22:29,200 --> 00:22:32,079
I'll have to carry
the burden of Du Zheng.

434
00:22:32,240 --> 00:22:34,278
Jinqi was talking nonsense.

435
00:22:34,279 --> 00:22:36,078
You mustn't take it to heart,

436
00:22:36,079 --> 00:22:37,320
understand?

437
00:22:37,400 --> 00:22:38,760
Jinqi said

438
00:22:39,119 --> 00:22:42,399
life is like sailing down a river.

439
00:22:42,480 --> 00:22:44,919
No one can
have calm waters all their life.

440
00:22:46,119 --> 00:22:47,760
If I'm a small boat,

441
00:22:48,400 --> 00:22:49,358
then sooner or later,

442
00:22:49,359 --> 00:22:51,439
the weight of Du Zheng will sink me.

443
00:22:52,480 --> 00:22:53,599
But

444
00:22:54,119 --> 00:22:55,639
if I'm a great ship,

445
00:22:56,279 --> 00:22:58,760
the larger the ship,
the smaller the stone becomes.

446
00:22:59,720 --> 00:23:02,520
As long as I can
make my ship large enough,

447
00:23:03,359 --> 00:23:04,560
one day,

448
00:23:05,279 --> 00:23:07,960
even if someone points
that stone out to me,

449
00:23:08,359 --> 00:23:10,679
it will be nothing
more than a tiny stone.

450
00:23:15,839 --> 00:23:16,839
Mother,

451
00:23:19,200 --> 00:23:20,839
I want to try

452
00:23:21,960 --> 00:23:24,480
to become the great ship Jinqi spoke of.

453
00:23:30,359 --> 00:23:31,439
All right.

454
00:23:32,079 --> 00:23:33,159
All right.

455
00:23:33,880 --> 00:23:36,000
Whether you want to become a great ship

456
00:23:36,960 --> 00:23:38,720
or build yourself a grand house,

457
00:23:40,559 --> 00:23:42,119
I'll help you.

458
00:23:50,200 --> 00:23:52,359
Don't resent Xiuru anymore.

459
00:23:53,240 --> 00:23:55,599
I may not become the Marchioness,

460
00:23:55,640 --> 00:23:57,599
but I'll become the Marquis's sister.

461
00:23:58,359 --> 00:24:00,358
When they see me in the future,

462
00:24:00,359 --> 00:24:02,800
they'll both have
to greet me properly as family.

463
00:24:04,039 --> 00:24:05,800
You silly girl.

464
00:24:10,839 --> 00:24:11,800
All right.

465
00:24:11,839 --> 00:24:12,800
All right.

466
00:24:14,279 --> 00:24:15,839
Whatever you say.

467
00:24:37,519 --> 00:24:38,558
Xiuru

468
00:24:38,559 --> 00:24:41,598
isn't your own daughter, after all.

469
00:24:41,600 --> 00:24:44,520
I'd say it's enough as long as
you observe the proper courtesies.

470
00:24:45,519 --> 00:24:47,159
The most pressing matter now

471
00:24:47,160 --> 00:24:49,159
is Young Master's marriage.

472
00:24:49,288 --> 00:24:51,070
Before, we had to consider
the Zhao family,

473
00:24:51,079 --> 00:24:52,679
so we couldn't look for a match.

474
00:24:52,680 --> 00:24:53,558
But now Zhao

475
00:24:53,559 --> 00:24:55,719
has been married off
to the capital for almost a year.

476
00:24:55,720 --> 00:24:57,919
You should start making careful plans

477
00:24:57,920 --> 00:24:59,760
for Young Master's marriage.

478
00:25:00,880 --> 00:25:03,000
You're even more anxious than I am.

479
00:25:03,624 --> 00:25:04,910
I've already asked a matchmaker

480
00:25:04,920 --> 00:25:07,000
to find Jiugao a wife.

481
00:25:07,200 --> 00:25:08,838
Young Master is

482
00:25:08,839 --> 00:25:10,760
several years older than Jiugao.

483
00:25:13,559 --> 00:25:14,879
It may not be pleasant to hear,

484
00:25:15,599 --> 00:25:17,399
but it's the plain truth.

485
00:25:21,960 --> 00:25:24,320
Jinqi is my only son.

486
00:25:24,799 --> 00:25:27,760
How could I not plan carefully for him?

487
00:25:28,440 --> 00:25:30,318
I think about it every day.

488
00:25:30,319 --> 00:25:32,159
So you already have someone in mind?

489
00:25:33,200 --> 00:25:34,599
Is there a suitable candidate?

490
00:25:39,559 --> 00:25:41,480
Duke Xianguo's youngest daughter.

491
00:25:48,599 --> 00:25:50,159
Now I remember.

492
00:25:50,279 --> 00:25:53,919
Duke Xianguo had a daughter
late in life after remarrying.

493
00:25:54,640 --> 00:25:57,599
I hear she's intelligent and gentle

494
00:25:57,920 --> 00:25:59,838
and has won
Dowager Consort Zheng's favor.

495
00:25:59,839 --> 00:26:01,639
She's been raised
in the palace ever since.

496
00:26:02,319 --> 00:26:03,639
Good heavens!

497
00:26:03,640 --> 00:26:04,952
The youngest daughter of a duke,

498
00:26:04,984 --> 00:26:06,910
raised by a dowager consort no less.

499
00:26:07,000 --> 00:26:08,919
No wonder you weren't in any hurry.

500
00:26:10,640 --> 00:26:13,200
Dowager Consort Zheng
and Old Madam go way back.

501
00:26:13,839 --> 00:26:16,760
The older people get,
the more they cherish old ties.

502
00:26:17,279 --> 00:26:19,599
They often exchange letters.

503
00:26:20,240 --> 00:26:21,518
I suppose

504
00:26:21,519 --> 00:26:23,919
she heard about Old Madam's troubles,

505
00:26:24,279 --> 00:26:25,359
and as it happens,

506
00:26:25,400 --> 00:26:27,838
Young Lady Zheng
has reached marriageable age,

507
00:26:27,839 --> 00:26:30,278
so she thought she'd play matchmaker

508
00:26:30,279 --> 00:26:32,040
and bring about a good match.

509
00:26:32,640 --> 00:26:33,959
She's already sent people

510
00:26:33,960 --> 00:26:35,960
to escort Young Lady Zheng
back to Jinling.

511
00:26:36,599 --> 00:26:38,999
So this is the match
that's been waiting for Young Master.

512
00:26:39,000 --> 00:26:42,038
Good things really are worth the wait.

513
00:26:42,039 --> 00:26:44,079
A fine man never
has to worry about finding a wife.

514
00:26:44,759 --> 00:26:46,280
When it comes to his marriage,

515
00:26:47,119 --> 00:26:49,679
I've always felt I let Jinqi down.

516
00:26:50,599 --> 00:26:51,639
Now,

517
00:26:51,839 --> 00:26:54,520
I've finally found him a young lady
from a distinguished family

518
00:26:54,960 --> 00:26:56,800
who is also learned and courteous.

519
00:26:58,720 --> 00:27:01,839
Young Master will surely be delighted.

520
00:27:17,279 --> 00:27:19,278
Playing the Child.

521
00:27:19,279 --> 00:27:20,639
One theory says

522
00:27:20,640 --> 00:27:23,318
it came from a Sanskrit street cry

523
00:27:23,319 --> 00:27:25,318
heard in the markets
of the Song dynasty,

524
00:27:25,319 --> 00:27:27,159
"Mohouluo."

525
00:27:27,359 --> 00:27:28,679
Another theory says

526
00:27:28,680 --> 00:27:32,758
it came from a sung entertainment
in Song dynasty theaters.

527
00:27:32,760 --> 00:27:34,520
The name
has been used for a Daoist ballad,

528
00:27:34,530 --> 00:27:35,990
a precious scroll tune, a melody,

529
00:27:36,000 --> 00:27:38,760
a lyric pattern, and a folk tune.

530
00:27:38,839 --> 00:27:41,518
It existed as early
as the Tang and Song dynasties.

531
00:27:41,519 --> 00:27:42,518
Today,

532
00:27:42,519 --> 00:27:45,560
the earliest surviving
Playing the Child...

533
00:27:54,680 --> 00:27:55,800
Young Master.

534
00:27:57,359 --> 00:27:59,240
Lanxiang isn't home.

535
00:28:03,119 --> 00:28:07,280
She's working at Mister Lu's,
transcribing songs and lyrics.

536
00:28:08,200 --> 00:28:09,078
Perfect.

537
00:28:09,079 --> 00:28:10,800
I'll pay Mister Lu a visit.

538
00:28:15,680 --> 00:28:17,399
Scholar Han is also...

539
00:28:17,519 --> 00:28:19,159
Also at Mister Lu's.

540
00:28:21,576 --> 00:28:22,950
He went there to borrow some books.

541
00:28:22,960 --> 00:28:24,240
He only left a short while ago.

542
00:28:38,039 --> 00:28:39,639
Young Master has distinguished bearing

543
00:28:39,640 --> 00:28:40,936
and remarkable courage and valor.

544
00:28:46,470 --> 00:28:47,976
Go back and copy
"Appearance" from A New Account

545
00:28:47,980 --> 00:28:49,390
of the Tales of the World ten times.

546
00:28:49,680 --> 00:28:51,399
Learn how to flatter someone properly.

547
00:28:59,519 --> 00:29:04,838
♪Quickly order Guan Ping
to light the lamp♪

548
00:29:04,839 --> 00:29:12,879
♪Let's discuss the Zuo Commentary
from the beginning♪

549
00:29:12,880 --> 00:29:23,439
♪The rise and fall of dynasties
after the former emperors♪

550
00:29:23,440 --> 00:29:38,000
♪How many emperors were wise,
and how many were foolish?♪

551
00:29:39,519 --> 00:29:48,959
♪The Zuo Commentary♪

552
00:29:48,960 --> 00:30:02,679
♪Let's discuss the Zuo Commentary
from the beginning♪

553
00:30:02,680 --> 00:30:09,959
♪The rise and fall of dynasties
after the former emperors♪

554
00:30:09,960 --> 00:30:21,720
♪How many emperors were wise,
and how many were foolish?♪

555
00:30:29,599 --> 00:30:30,399
Good.

556
00:30:34,119 --> 00:30:35,159
Young Master.

557
00:30:36,480 --> 00:30:38,000
Young Master, what brings you here?

558
00:30:43,519 --> 00:30:44,879
My surname is Lin,

559
00:30:44,880 --> 00:30:46,078
given name Jinqi,

560
00:30:46,079 --> 00:30:47,280
courtesy name Fengtai.

561
00:30:47,384 --> 00:30:48,824
Forgive me for calling unannounced.

562
00:30:48,830 --> 00:30:50,490
When I heard
such a wonderful performance,

563
00:30:50,500 --> 00:30:52,159
I couldn't help applauding and cheering.

564
00:30:52,240 --> 00:30:54,000
I'm sorry to have

565
00:30:54,160 --> 00:30:55,439
disturbed you, Sir.

566
00:30:58,839 --> 00:31:00,720
Your grandfather

567
00:31:00,839 --> 00:31:03,079
is Lin Zhaoxiang?

568
00:31:09,279 --> 00:31:13,320
We follow different paths
and have nothing to say to each other.

569
00:31:33,480 --> 00:31:34,679
It's just a small gift.

570
00:31:34,839 --> 00:31:36,000
Please accept it.

571
00:31:46,960 --> 00:31:48,278
Mister Lu is drunk.

572
00:31:48,279 --> 00:31:49,159
When he sobers up,

573
00:31:49,160 --> 00:31:50,424
I'll tell him about your visit.

574
00:31:51,400 --> 00:31:52,159
Young Master,

575
00:31:52,160 --> 00:31:53,464
come sit at my house for a while.

576
00:31:54,160 --> 00:31:55,040
All right.

577
00:31:55,680 --> 00:31:56,760
I'll see you over.

578
00:32:00,400 --> 00:32:01,598
Grandpa Tu,

579
00:32:01,599 --> 00:32:03,439
we left the gifts on the table.

580
00:32:05,440 --> 00:32:06,159
This way.

581
00:32:15,368 --> 00:32:17,110
I heard you were promoted, Young Master.

582
00:32:17,110 --> 00:32:18,344
Mother and I made some pastries,

583
00:32:18,350 --> 00:32:20,000
and Father brought them
to your residence.

584
00:32:20,056 --> 00:32:21,280
Congratulations, Young Master.

585
00:32:21,640 --> 00:32:23,439
Congratulations, Commander Lin.

586
00:32:26,960 --> 00:32:28,079
This door...

587
00:32:28,440 --> 00:32:29,480
You don't close it?

588
00:32:30,039 --> 00:32:31,358
Not during the day.

589
00:32:31,359 --> 00:32:33,798
I need to study the songs
and transcribe them,

590
00:32:33,799 --> 00:32:35,320
so I'm constantly coming and going.

591
00:32:35,880 --> 00:32:36,919
Mister Lu and Grandpa Tu

592
00:32:36,920 --> 00:32:38,679
both enjoy my mother's cooking.

593
00:32:38,680 --> 00:32:41,679
Mother also says
it's easier to cook for more people,

594
00:32:41,680 --> 00:32:43,200
so we all eat together every day.

595
00:32:44,039 --> 00:32:45,240
This way, Young Master.

596
00:32:46,808 --> 00:32:48,630
My mother went to Scholar Han's house

597
00:32:48,640 --> 00:32:50,919
to do needlework with Madam Han.

598
00:32:50,960 --> 00:32:52,599
My father is at the shop out front.

599
00:32:56,559 --> 00:32:57,118
Young Master,

600
00:32:57,119 --> 00:32:57,919
have a seat.

601
00:32:58,119 --> 00:32:59,280
I'll make some tea.

602
00:33:19,559 --> 00:33:22,159
Do you study entirely
on your own, Scholar Han,

603
00:33:22,319 --> 00:33:23,800
without a teacher to guide you?

604
00:33:23,920 --> 00:33:25,558
When Mister Lu is in a good mood,

605
00:33:25,559 --> 00:33:27,040
he'll offer me some guidance.

606
00:33:28,359 --> 00:33:30,119
Mister Lu is immensely learned,

607
00:33:30,200 --> 00:33:31,679
but for the provincial examination,

608
00:33:31,720 --> 00:33:33,832
you still need
to review every subject thoroughly.

609
00:33:35,920 --> 00:33:38,359
I was once a student of Scholar Shouyi.

610
00:33:38,640 --> 00:33:40,038
If you're willing,

611
00:33:40,039 --> 00:33:41,919
I can recommend you to Qixia Academy

612
00:33:41,920 --> 00:33:43,639
to study under Scholar Shouyi.

613
00:33:44,960 --> 00:33:46,479
I've long heard of Scholar Shouyi's

614
00:33:46,480 --> 00:33:47,598
great reputation.

615
00:33:47,599 --> 00:33:49,439
To have the chance
to study at Qixia Academy

616
00:33:49,440 --> 00:33:50,879
would be an honor for me.

617
00:33:54,319 --> 00:33:56,800
Scholar Han is going
to study at Qixia Academy?

618
00:34:10,480 --> 00:34:11,479
It's just that

619
00:34:11,840 --> 00:34:13,320
my circumstances are unusual,

620
00:34:13,760 --> 00:34:15,080
and I have other plans.

621
00:34:15,119 --> 00:34:16,800
I can only appreciate

622
00:34:17,199 --> 00:34:18,919
your kind offer, Commander Lin.

623
00:34:43,079 --> 00:34:45,160
Young Master,
are you here to see my father?

624
00:34:47,920 --> 00:34:50,439
Yesterday was Xiuru's
betrothal ceremony.

625
00:34:50,472 --> 00:34:52,760
First Madam asked me
to bring over two boxes of pastries

626
00:34:52,824 --> 00:34:54,320
so you could share in the joy.

627
00:34:54,679 --> 00:34:55,959
Thank you, Young Master.

628
00:34:57,280 --> 00:34:58,479
There's something else.

629
00:34:58,760 --> 00:34:59,879
Yuchan and Gantang

630
00:34:59,880 --> 00:35:01,439
asked me to bring this to you.

631
00:35:02,000 --> 00:35:03,399
What is it?

632
00:35:22,760 --> 00:35:23,879
An orchid?

633
00:35:24,519 --> 00:35:26,680
Why would they specially
send me a potted orchid?

634
00:35:30,639 --> 00:35:32,200
(What flower is that fragrance from?)

635
00:35:32,519 --> 00:35:33,839
(An orchid.)

636
00:35:34,880 --> 00:35:37,720
Some orchids are most fragrant at noon,

637
00:35:38,239 --> 00:35:41,120
while others are most fragrant at night.

638
00:35:42,000 --> 00:35:43,399
It smells wonderful.

639
00:35:46,040 --> 00:35:48,390
Didn't you say it blooms
at night and smells wonderful?

640
00:35:48,840 --> 00:35:50,120
I happened to divide the plant,

641
00:35:50,719 --> 00:35:51,999
so I brought you

642
00:35:52,070 --> 00:35:53,224
one of the new shoots.

643
00:35:58,920 --> 00:36:00,638
Thanks to Yuchan and Gantang.

644
00:36:00,640 --> 00:36:02,664
They even remembered
to bring me a potted flower.

645
00:36:13,920 --> 00:36:14,839
I should

646
00:36:15,599 --> 00:36:16,999
get back to my studies.

647
00:36:21,199 --> 00:36:22,600
I should be going, too.

648
00:36:23,032 --> 00:36:24,870
You both
have important matters to attend to,

649
00:36:24,880 --> 00:36:26,399
so I won't keep you.

650
00:36:26,519 --> 00:36:27,680
Take care, Young Master.

651
00:36:28,000 --> 00:36:29,280
Take care, Scholar Han.

652
00:37:54,760 --> 00:37:57,160
Why won't you go study at Qixia Academy?

653
00:37:58,039 --> 00:38:00,800
Scholar Shouyi
is a renowned scholar of our time.

654
00:38:01,400 --> 00:38:03,598
You clearly seemed interested.

655
00:38:03,599 --> 00:38:05,959
Why did you turn down
Young Master Lin's kind offer?

656
00:38:11,624 --> 00:38:13,280
I can't accept a favor I haven't earned.

657
00:38:15,480 --> 00:38:17,200
Commander Lin and I

658
00:38:17,719 --> 00:38:19,080
are neither family nor old friends.

659
00:38:20,239 --> 00:38:21,720
I'm afraid of owing him a favor

660
00:38:21,800 --> 00:38:23,160
I may never be able to repay.

661
00:38:28,639 --> 00:38:29,399
Wait here.

662
00:38:29,400 --> 00:38:30,640
I have something for you.

663
00:39:06,180 --> 00:39:10,020
(Fang Yu, Qixia Academy)

664
00:39:13,400 --> 00:39:14,399
This is...

665
00:39:14,679 --> 00:39:16,359
Scholar Shouyi's calling card?

666
00:39:18,960 --> 00:39:21,720
Scholar Shouyi gave it to me by chance.

667
00:39:22,039 --> 00:39:24,799
He said if I ever went to Qixia Academy,

668
00:39:24,800 --> 00:39:26,760
I could take this to him.

669
00:39:26,840 --> 00:39:29,496
But I'm not pursuing an official career
through the examinations,

670
00:39:29,528 --> 00:39:31,430
so this card is of little use to me.

671
00:39:32,639 --> 00:39:34,379
Take it and go see Scholar Shouyi.

672
00:39:34,380 --> 00:39:40,539
♪If you're a lone traveler
returning through the snow♪

673
00:39:40,540 --> 00:39:43,819
(Fang Yu, Qixia Academy)

674
00:39:43,820 --> 00:39:51,460
♪Let me brush the dust
of your journey from your shoulders♪

675
00:39:53,740 --> 00:39:57,500
♪If you're the silent fragrance
of a secluded orchid♪

676
00:39:58,400 --> 00:39:59,559
Scholar Han.

677
00:39:59,840 --> 00:40:01,320
Why aren't you saying anything?

678
00:40:04,800 --> 00:40:07,160
Don't worry about not being
able to repay the favor.

679
00:40:07,239 --> 00:40:10,160
My favor isn't nearly
as great as Young Master Lin's.

680
00:40:11,199 --> 00:40:13,839
I can only get you
a meeting with Scholar Shouyi,

681
00:40:13,840 --> 00:40:16,479
but I can't guarantee
he'll be willing to guide you.

682
00:40:17,159 --> 00:40:18,038
Besides,

683
00:40:18,039 --> 00:40:20,160
you introduced me to Mister Lu.

684
00:40:20,199 --> 00:40:20,919
So

685
00:40:20,920 --> 00:40:22,479
I'll use Scholar Shouyi

686
00:40:22,480 --> 00:40:23,959
to repay that favor.

687
00:40:23,960 --> 00:40:25,240
Now we're even.

688
00:40:30,280 --> 00:40:31,919
I'm just so happy

689
00:40:32,719 --> 00:40:34,240
I don't know what to say.

690
00:40:37,320 --> 00:40:38,678
I'll go check on Mister Lu.

691
00:40:38,679 --> 00:40:40,399
I still haven't memorized
what he taught me

692
00:40:40,400 --> 00:40:41,784
about Playing the Child today.

693
00:40:41,832 --> 00:40:42,740
All right.

694
00:40:48,420 --> 00:41:02,820
♪How could I know spring could be
so beautiful without entering the garden?♪

695
00:41:10,280 --> 00:41:11,399
Mother.

696
00:41:11,760 --> 00:41:12,598
Liang.

697
00:41:12,599 --> 00:41:13,638
Do you want some water too?

698
00:41:13,639 --> 00:41:15,999
I'll pour some for them in a moment,
then I'll get you some.

699
00:41:17,400 --> 00:41:18,399
You...

700
00:41:19,400 --> 00:41:20,198
Liang.

701
00:41:20,199 --> 00:41:21,240
You...

702
00:41:23,679 --> 00:41:25,240
I've fallen for Lanxiang

703
00:41:26,280 --> 00:41:27,640
and want to ask you

704
00:41:28,239 --> 00:41:29,959
to find a matchmaker
and propose marriage.

705
00:41:33,280 --> 00:41:34,800
Silly boy.

706
00:41:35,119 --> 00:41:36,479
We figured out how you felt

707
00:41:36,480 --> 00:41:38,640
a long time ago.

708
00:41:42,639 --> 00:41:43,479
Does

709
00:41:43,800 --> 00:41:45,320
Aunt Xu know, too?

710
00:41:46,679 --> 00:41:48,078
Don't worry.

711
00:41:48,079 --> 00:41:49,800
I know what to do.

712
00:41:50,159 --> 00:41:52,240
We don't have much
to offer as betrothal gifts.

713
00:41:52,280 --> 00:41:54,760
If you pass the examination
before proposing,

714
00:41:54,800 --> 00:41:57,359
wouldn't that bring
Lanxiang greater honor?

715
00:42:00,000 --> 00:42:01,120
Mother.

716
00:42:01,880 --> 00:42:03,959
Lanxiang isn't someone
who cares about such things.

717
00:42:05,239 --> 00:42:06,399
Let's not wait.

718
00:42:06,400 --> 00:42:08,648
Please find a matchmaker
and propose as soon as possible.

719
00:42:09,679 --> 00:42:10,999
I'm afraid if we wait,

720
00:42:11,800 --> 00:42:13,479
someone else will beat me to it.

721
00:42:15,199 --> 00:42:16,238
Who?

722
00:42:16,239 --> 00:42:17,559
Madam Han!

723
00:42:18,239 --> 00:42:19,439
Coming!

724
00:42:19,440 --> 00:42:20,559
Mother.

725
00:42:21,840 --> 00:42:22,919
All right.

726
00:42:22,920 --> 00:42:24,678
I'll do as you say.

727
00:42:24,679 --> 00:42:27,238
Once I've prepared the gifts,
I'll find a matchmaker.

728
00:42:27,239 --> 00:42:28,800
Silly boy.

729
00:42:29,920 --> 00:42:30,959
Coming!

730
00:42:51,630 --> 00:42:54,312
As expected of someone raised
by Dowager Consort Zheng.

731
00:42:54,424 --> 00:42:55,832
(Zheng Manyi, Duke Xianguo's)
Manyi's manners

732
00:42:55,840 --> 00:42:57,270
(Youngest Daughter)
and bearing...

733
00:42:57,679 --> 00:42:59,038
She outshines all the young ladies

734
00:42:59,039 --> 00:43:00,600
in our Lin family.

735
00:43:04,780 --> 00:43:07,660
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

736
00:43:08,159 --> 00:43:10,800
This orchid is very much to my liking.

737
00:43:13,079 --> 00:43:15,280
I'm willing to pay a high price for it.

738
00:43:16,920 --> 00:43:18,158
I'm very sorry,

739
00:43:18,159 --> 00:43:20,720
but my daughter raised this orchid,

740
00:43:20,960 --> 00:43:22,120
so it isn't for sale.

741
00:43:26,880 --> 00:43:29,600
Could you ask your daughter to come out
so we can discuss it?

742
00:43:29,719 --> 00:43:32,039
Perhaps if she sees how sincere I am,

743
00:43:33,079 --> 00:43:34,640
she'll be willing to part with it.

744
00:43:34,880 --> 00:43:35,999
Well...

745
00:43:39,000 --> 00:43:40,120
Then...

746
00:43:40,320 --> 00:43:41,680
Please wait a moment.

747
00:43:42,599 --> 00:43:43,919
Lanxiang!

748
00:43:44,239 --> 00:43:45,399
Lanxiang!

749
00:43:45,519 --> 00:43:46,999
Come here for a moment.

750
00:43:47,119 --> 00:43:50,600
A customer wants to buy
the orchid you've been raising.

751
00:43:51,599 --> 00:43:52,518
Coming!

752
00:43:52,519 --> 00:43:54,160
I'll just wipe my hands and come over.

753
00:44:29,620 --> 00:44:33,740
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

754
00:44:36,580 --> 00:44:41,100
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

755
00:44:42,380 --> 00:44:46,300
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

756
00:44:46,980 --> 00:44:49,740
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

757
00:44:50,460 --> 00:44:52,780
♪Though all the world may fade♪

758
00:44:52,780 --> 00:44:55,860
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

759
00:44:57,380 --> 00:45:01,620
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

760
00:45:04,540 --> 00:45:08,700
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

761
00:45:10,500 --> 00:45:14,060
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

762
00:45:14,060 --> 00:45:17,620
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

763
00:45:18,420 --> 00:45:24,100
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

764
00:45:24,460 --> 00:45:28,780
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

765
00:45:29,140 --> 00:45:32,100
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

766
00:45:32,100 --> 00:45:35,860
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

767
00:45:35,860 --> 00:45:38,740
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

768
00:45:38,740 --> 00:45:42,820
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

769
00:45:42,820 --> 00:45:46,180
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

770
00:45:46,180 --> 00:45:49,940
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

771
00:45:49,940 --> 00:45:53,940
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

772
00:45:54,700 --> 00:45:58,860
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

773
00:45:58,860 --> 00:46:02,300
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

774
00:46:02,300 --> 00:46:05,940
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

775
00:46:05,940 --> 00:46:08,820
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

776
00:46:08,820 --> 00:46:12,900
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

777
00:46:12,900 --> 00:46:16,260
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

778
00:46:16,260 --> 00:46:19,900
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

779
00:46:19,900 --> 00:46:27,700
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
